 ],
 "synopsis": "Condiment and sauce firm Veeba Foods, founded by Viraj Bahl and backed by investors including Verlinvest, DSG Consumer Partners, and Saama Capital, has kicked off a pre-IPO capital raise and secondary minority sale of under 10 percent. The company is targeting a valuation of over Rs 8,000 crore, which will help set a valuation benchmark ahead of a planned listing and diversify the cap table. Advisers working on the transaction include Axis Capital, Jefferies, Motilal Oswal, and 360 One Capital, who have started reaching out to potential investors.",
